<td VALIGN=TOP COLSPAN="2"><b><font face="Arial"><font size=-1>
So are you thinking about listing your Emerald Coast vacation property on BeachBreak? </font></font></b>
<br>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td ALIGN=LEFT><font face="Arial"><font size=-1>Is's so easy to get your propety listed with beachbreak it's not even funny.  Here's all you have to do.  Send me an <a href="MAILTO:webmaster@beachbreak.com">email</a> that includes: Property Name, Property Description, Property Location, Email Address and your Rates (day,week,month for summer, winter, spring and fall). attach to the email any photos that you happen to have.  Usually, we take 3 photos and make one photo out of them for your listing.  If you don't have electronically formatted photos, we can take care of that for you as well.  Just send them regular mail to the address below:
<br><br>
webflux<br>
4485B Luke Avenue<br>
Destin Fl, 32541<br>
<br>
email - <a href="MAILTO:webmaster@beachbreak.com">webmaster@beachbreak.com</a>
</font></font>
<br>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td ALIGN=LEFT><font face="Arial"><font size=-1>It will take us about 48 hours to get your listing up.  We are glad you are considering BeachBreak.  We have had many satisfied customers and owners and we hope your listing is as successful.</font></font>
<br>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td ALIGN=LEFT><font face="Arial"><font size=-1>Our rates are $85/year for a single property.  Right now we are offering a special where you can list your property at BeachBreaks' sister site <a href="http://www.frbodirect.com">FRBOdirect</a> (For Rent By Owner Direct) for an additional $50.  We accept checks and money orders only.  Make all payments payable to webflux.  Thanks for your interest!!
<br>
<br>

<a href="MAILTO:webmaster@beachbreak.com">Scott R. Henson</a>
<br>
proprietor

</font></font>
<br>&nbsp;</td>
</tr>


<tr>
<td COLSPAN="2">
